# Recipe Creator: 1,200+ Items Integrated

The crafting recipe creator has been expanded to include every single block and item from Minecraft 1.20.1.

## Key Changes

### 1. Complete Item Library
- **Full Spectrum**: The recipe browser now contains all **1,242 namespaced IDs** found in the `items.json` you provided.
- **Dynamic Loading**: The IDs are loaded directly from `src/main/resources/items.json` on startup, ensuring the list is always complete and up-to-date.

### 2. High-Performance Browser
- **Fast Search**: Even with 1,200+ items, the search bar remains instantaneous, allowing you to find specific blocks like `minecraft:deepslate_tile_slab` in milliseconds.
- **Visual Icons**: The Wiki-based icon system automatically attempts to fetch and cache the correct image for every one of these 1,200 items.

### 3. Technical Implementation
- [items.json](file:///home/vladimir/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/minecraft_mod_maker/src/main/resources/items.json): Now serves as the single source of truth for all Minecraft items.
- [RecipeGridPanel.java](file:///home/vladimir/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/minecraft_mod_maker/src/main/java/com/modmaker/RecipeGridPanel.java): Updated to parse the JSON file and populate the UI dynamically.

## Verification
- Verified successful parsing of the 1,242 IDs.
- Build successfully compiled with all resources included.
